# Custom Suricata Detection Rules
# Author: Rahul Sunouri | CodSoft Cyber Security Internship — Task 4
#
# Detects a potential SSH brute-force attempt: fires once a single source IP
# makes 5 or more connection attempts to port 22 within a 60-second window.
alert tcp any any -> $HOME_NET 22 (msg:"SSH connection attempt"; sid:1000001; rev:1; detection_filter:track by_src, count 5, seconds 60;)
